# Taii Wakeen's ruling (CR 616.1, 615.6): when damage meets Taii's "plus X" and a prevention shield, the player it would be
# dealt to orders them; if all of it is prevented, Taii's effect no longer applies. Bot1 activates Taii for X = 2 and Bolts Bot2,
# who shields itself with Healing Salve in response. Bot2 has the Salve apply first: 3 is prevented, nothing is left to add to,
# and Bot2 takes 0. At the second Bolt, with a second Salve, Bot2 has Taii's effect apply first: 3 + 2 = 5, of which 3 are
# prevented, so Bot2 takes 2 (18).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Taii Wakeen, Perfect Shot
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Healing Salve
Healing Salve
Island x16

